            "background_color": "",
            "title": "Vinyl flooring for bathrooms",
            "content": "<p>Vinyl flooring is ideally suited to bathrooms and wet areas. It’s also a great option when you’re on a budget with prices starting from around £10 per square metre. It’s cushioned, so it’s warm and soft underfoot and it’s impervious to splashes and spills. Our vinyl flooring comes in all kinds of geometric tile and wood effects, so you get the look of the real thing without the cost and it’ so easy to fit too!</p>\n<p>Choose from a wide range of wood, stone and ceramic tile effect finishes, as well as modern geometric designs. Most vinyl we offer, also comes with a textured finish to emulate the look of wood or tile grouting, and provides a slip resistant surface for added safety.</p>",
